           <lb/><persName>Winnifred Reeve</persName>
        </byline>
        <pb rendition="filmpage:yellow"/>
        <ab>ROPES</ab>
        <castList>
           <head>CHARACTERS</head>
           <castItem xml:id="JennyBlake">
              <role>Jenny Blake</role> (<actor>Mary Nolan</actor>)
              <note>
                 <p>A girl of about 20. Flippant and pleasure loving, dance and boy mad, pretty and sexy. Lightheaded and vain. The kind of girl men go crazy about. Beneath her flighty ways, Jenny has a warm loveable nature.</p>
                 <p>Jenny is a product of the east side</p>
              </note>
           </castItem>
           <castItem xml:id="PaulWhalen">
              <role>Paul Whalen</role>
           </castItem>
           <castItem>
              <role>Jim Paine</role> (<actor>Eddie Phillips</actor>?)
           </castItem>
           <castItem>
              <note>People on the public beach. Jen's young friends — boys and girls &amp;c.</note>
           </castItem>
        </castList>
        <pb rendition="filmpage:yellow"/>
        <div>
           <!--How do we represent this setList in a way that is
           parallel to a castList? -->
           <list>
              
              <item>
                 <label>
                    <placeName>PUBLIC BEACH</placeName> ---Coney, Brighton...--- where we decide
                 </label>
                 <note>
                    <p>
                       At the beach
                       <list>
                          <item>Life guard look-out station</item>
                          <item>Siren pole. on beach</item>
                          <item>Hot dog and hamburger shack.</item>
                       </list>
                    </p>
                 </note>
              </item>
              <item>
                 <label>PUBLIC DANCE HALL ON PIER</label>
              </item>
              <item>
                 <label>BEACH STREET</label>
                 <note>
                    <p>All we need is the outside of teh window of Justice</p>
                 </note>
              </item>
              <item>
                 <label>Exterior:</label>
                 <list>
                    <item>
                       <label>LIGHTHOUSE</label>
                       <note>
                          <list>
                             <item>LIVING ROOM</item>
                             <item>TOWER WITH THE BIG LIGHT</item>
                          </list>
                       </note>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                       <label>Small bea<supplied>c</supplied>h harbor for boats.</label>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                       <label>The open sea.</label>
                    </item>
                 </list>
              </item>
           </list>
        </div>
        
